        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Corgan, Yelena Yemchuk\n- Bands: The Smashing Pumpkins\n- Albums: Adore\n- Songs: Perfect, Ava Adore, Crestfallen\n- Topics: commercial singles, promotional singles, single artwork\n\nFacts:\n- The Smashing Pumpkins released \"Adore\" as their fourth album.\n- \"Perfect\" was the final commercial single from \"Adore.\"\n- After \"Perfect,\" two songs from \"Adore\" were released as promotional singles.\n- \"Crestfallen\" was one of the promotional singles released after \"Perfect.\"\n- The artwork for one of those promotional singles was created by Ukrainian photographer Yelena Yemchuk.",
